#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1033
msgid ""
"There was an error setting up inter-process\n"
"communications for KDE.  The message returned\n"
"by the system was:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Le hewldan bo peywendîgirtin\n"
"kêsheyekî nêwxoyî prosekanî KDE hate arawe.\n"
"Sistêm em peyamey r`ageyand:\n"
"\n"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1037
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Please check that the \"dcopserver\" program is running!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Tikaye dilniyabe ke bernamey \"dcopserver\" le kardaye!"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1040
msgid "DCOP communications error (%1)"
msgstr "Kêey Peywendî DCOP (%1)"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1048
msgid "Use the X-server display 'displayname'."
msgstr "Rûtextî (shashey) X-server y \"shashe\" bekarbêne."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1049
msgid "Restore the application for the given 'sessionId'."
msgstr "Karpêerî \"sessionId\" biger`ênewe barî pêshû."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"Causes the application to install a private color\n"
"map on an 8-bit display."
msgstr ""
"Rêgay amadekirdinî texter`engî taybet dedat leser shasheyekî 8 bîtî\n"
"(8bit-Display)"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1051
msgid ""
"Limits the number of colors allocated in the color\n"
"cube on an 8-bit display, if the application is\n"
"using the QApplication::ManyColor color\n"
"specification."
msgstr ""
"Eger bernameyek QApplication \"ManyColor\" \n"
"bekarbênêt jimarey ew renganey leser shashey\n"
"8 bîtî nîshan dedrên sinûrdar dakat."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1052
msgid "tells Qt to never grab the mouse or the keyboard."
msgstr "Be Qt radegeyenê hergîz cêng le mishko û pîtçin negrêt."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1053
msgid ""
"running under a debugger can cause an implicit\n"
"-nograb, use -dograb to override."
msgstr ""
"Begir`xistin le jêr debugger debête hoy çenglênegirtinêkî\n"
"na ashkera -nograb, çenglêgirtin -dograb bekarbêne bo paknûsî"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1054
msgid "switches to synchronous mode for debugging."
msgstr "Dubbugkirdin dexate barî sînkron."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1056
msgid "defines the application font."
msgstr "Pîtî karpêkirdin destnîshan dekat."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1058
msgid ""
"sets the default background color and an\n"
"application palette (light and dark shades are\n"
"calculated)."
msgstr ""
"sets the default background color and an\n"
"application palette (light and dark shades are\n"
"calculated)."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1060
msgid "sets the default foreground color."
msgstr "Rengî asayî rûzemîn diyarî dakat."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1062
msgid "sets the default button color."
msgstr "Rengî asayî dugme diyarî dakat."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:1063
